# The build context is the repository root for every image, so anything here
# is read once per image built. The Go image narrows it further with
# `COPY backend/`, which is why none of the node_modules trees reaches it.
#
# These are the directories that are large, are rebuilt inside the image
# anyway, or are somebody's laptop.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist

.git
**/.env
.files
bin

design
*.log
.DS_Store
.claude
